Subject: [flux] Call the product Flux

IDS_PRODUCT_NAME is what the window title, the task manager, the about page
and a few dozen other surfaces read from - patch 0001 only rewrote the
BRANDING file, which does not reach any of them. It is also the string the
side panel header shows for the Flux entry.

--- a/chrome/app/chromium_strings.grd
+++ b/chrome/app/chromium_strings.grd
@@ -294,10 +294,10 @@
         </then>
         <else>
           <message name="IDS_PRODUCT_NAME" desc="The Chrome application name" translateable="false">
-            Chromium
+            Flux
           </message>
           <message name="IDS_SHORT_PRODUCT_NAME" desc="The Chrome application short name." translateable="false">
-            Chromium
+            Flux
           </message>
         </else>
       </if>
